{"id": "34141", "title": "灶王书(子不语3)", "author": "安琦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34141/34141s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34141.htm", "intro": "豆豉、豆豉……少了豆豉，走了味，非同小可啊！闪闪闪，快闪人哪，挡她找豆豉者死──虽然大伙儿都说被她烹煮的鸡真是好福气；虽然作菜也不是件那么讨人厌的事，还可图个温饱，可是，她就是不想顺遂了爷爷那老顽固的意嘛！早说了她不是天生有双巧手的姊姊了呀，可爷那老番癫还是成天在她耳边灶君灶君又菜心菜心的，真气人！就是生气！所以别怪她跟人跑了！啊！这笨贼……不仅嘴刁，拳脚功夫也一把罩，太好了！也许她可以一道菜换他一招式，等她习会了功夫……呵呵！这死小子，作啥这么聪明呢？居然看得透她习武居心不良，只是拿来逃避的……他真的懂她，懂她的菜，也懂她的心……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34141", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2170827.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2170828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2170829.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2170830.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2170831.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2170832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2170833.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2170834.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2170835.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2170836.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2170837.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2170838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2170839.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2170840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2170841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2170842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2170843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2170844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2170845.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2170846.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2170847.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2170848.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2170849.html", "available": false}, {"title": 